 [IMG]https://files.catbox.moe/347t1s.png[/IMG] 
Automate safe, scheduled resource-world regeneration with evacuation, verification, history, operator controls, and player teleport menus.

[B][IMG]https://files.catbox.moe/cja623.png[/IMG]   
Spigot / CraftBukkit[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Install [B]RWR-Spigot-5.0.0.jar[/B].
[*]Requires [URL='https://modrinth.com/plugin/multiverse-core']Multiverse-Core 5.8.0+[/URL].
[/LIST]
[B]Paper / Purpur / Folia[/B]
[LIST]
[*]Install [B]RWR-Paper-Folia-5.0.0.jar[/B].
[*]Requires [URL='https://modrinth.com/plugin/worlds-1']Worlds by TheNextLvl 4.4.0+[/URL].
[*]This build does not use Multiverse-Core.
[/LIST]
Install exactly one RWR platform JAR. The shared core is already included.

[IMG]https://files.catbox.moe/nczm04.png[/IMG]     
[LIST]
[*]Daily, weekly, monthly, and interval reset schedules
[*]Configurable warning countdowns and timezone-aware next-run calculation
[*]Safe player evacuation before regeneration
[*]Post-regeneration world, identity, loaded-state, and spawn verification
[*]Crash journal and conservative interrupted-operation recovery
[*]Admin dashboard, reset confirmation, history, status, and configuration GUIs
[*]Player teleport GUI with permissions, pagination, player counts, and reset-phase blocking
[*]Public cancellable pre-reset and terminal post-reset events
[*]Folia-safe scheduling and non-blocking player evacuation
[*]MiniMessage-based messages and friendly server logging
[/LIST]
[SIZE=5][B][IMG]https://files.catbox.moe/j4bfr7.png[/IMG]   [/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*]Java 21+
[*]Minecraft API 1.21.4+, including the 26.x server line
[*]A supported world-management plugin matching the selected RWR build
[/LIST]
[SIZE=5][B][IMG]https://files.catbox.moe/m4mpnm.png[/IMG]   [/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*][B]/rwr help[/B] — Permission-aware help
[*][B]/rwr status [id][/B] ([B]rwr.status[/B]) — Live reset / schedule status
[*][B]/rwr gui[/B] ([B]rwr.admin[/B]) — Admin configuration GUI
[*][B]/rwr tp[/B] ([B]rwr.tp[/B]) — Player teleport menu
[*][B]/rwr reset <id>[/B] ([B]rwr.reset[/B]) — Guarded immediate reset
[*][B]/rwr history [n][/B] ([B]rwr.history[/B]) — Recent reset history
[*][B]/rwr reload[/B] ([B]rwr.reload[/B]) — Transactional config reload
[/LIST]
[SIZE=5][B][IMG]https://files.catbox.moe/nwrda9.png[/IMG]   [/B][/SIZE]
[LIST]
[*][B]rwr.admin[/B] (op) — Full admin GUI and admin actions
[*][B]rwr.reload[/B] (op) — Reload configuration
[*][B]rwr.reset[/B] (op) — Force a guarded reset
[*][B]rwr.status[/B] (op) — View status
[*][B]rwr.history[/B] (op) — View reset history
[*][B]rwr.tp[/B] (true) — Open the teleport GUI
[*][B]rwr.teleport.world.*[/B] (op) — Bypass per-destination teleport permissions
[/LIST]
Leave a destination [B]permission[/B] blank to make it public to anyone with [B]rwr.tp[/B]. Set it to any Bukkit node (for example a LuckPerms group) to restrict that destination.

Back up the plugin data folder and managed worlds before upgrading. Version 4.2.1 and earlier belong to the legacy v4 line; v5 uses a new configuration and must be migrated manually.

